Moon Audio

This repository is a clean-room MoonBit implementation of WAV PCM and Ogg
Vorbis decoding. It was informed by the following public-domain references:

* stb_vorbis, Sean Barrett, https://github.com/nothings/stb
  Public domain / dual-licensed MIT.
* dr_wav, David Reid, https://github.com/mackron/dr_libs
  Public domain / MIT-0.

No upstream source file is included in this repository. The parser, decoder,
tests, and documentation here were written for MoonBit.
